OL,3,GNEWSAChief constable welcomes
OL,4,A'significant' explosives find
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Service of Northern Ireland
OL,7,F(PSNI) Chief Constable Jon Boutcher has
OL,8,Fwelcomed the seizure of suspected
OL,9,Fexplosive material by police in the
OL,10,FRepublic of Ireland.
OL,12,FGardai (Irish police) said component
OL,13,Fparts and suspected explosive material
OL,14,Fwere seized following a search in
OL,15,FCounty Louth on Thursday.
OL,17,FTwo men, aged in their 50s and 20s,
OL,18,Fhave been arrested following the
OL,19,Fseizure, which Garda Commissioner
OL,20,FJustin Kelly described as "a
OL,21,Fparticularly significant find".
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
