OL,3,GNEWSAChief constable welcomes
OL,4,A'significant' explosives find
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We will continue to work closely with
OL,7,FAn Garda Siochana as part of our shared
OL,8,Fcommitment to counter the threat posed
OL,9,Fby dissident republican groups,"
OL,10,FBoutcher said in a statement.
